<title>HONG KONG: Trading in East Asiatic shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in East Asiatic shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of East Asiatic Co (Hong Kong) Ltd was suspended on Thursday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>The company said last month that its Danish parent East Asiatic Co Ltd had put forward a proposal to privatise the Hong Kong company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
